{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-38","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","englishTitle":"If a number have any part whatever, it will be measured by a number called by the same name as the part.","book":7,"number":38,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.38","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.38/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":38,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-38@raw-5c93cf195ed3d752","contentId":"euclid-7-38","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5c93cf195ed3d752fcce8bddaf87302427b73fc74b870ca6fe57b272c29b9588","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-38.statement","euclid-7-38.construction.1","euclid-7-38.proof.1","euclid-7-38.proof.2","euclid-7-38.conclusion","euclid-7-38.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-38.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-38","revisionId":"euclid-7-38@raw-5c93cf195ed3d752","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3f7c640ef4e51b8607003e55e376f55366d09a199a56c6a47deb9a594342787f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a number have any part whatever, it will be measured by a number called by the same name as the part."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个数字有任何部分,则用与该部分同名的号码计量。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-38.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-38","revisionId":"euclid-7-38@raw-5c93cf195ed3d752","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"868a2d55f205e774d8f0d644a213b7c11ec9e440785589c379220cf0326db951","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the number A have any part whatever, B, and let C be a number called by the same name as the part B; I say that C measures A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A码随便什么,B,C码与B码同名;我说C 整除 A码。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-38.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-38","revisionId":"euclid-7-38@raw-5c93cf195ed3d752","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d681198deab7eadc27e2bb6d5c5371792c7e148436a552b2863ca07700a56a0c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since B is a part of A called by the same name as C, and the unit D is also a part of C called by the same name as it, therefore, whatever part the unit D is of the number C, the same part is B of A also; therefore the unit D measures the number C the same number of times that B measures A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为B是A中C中的一部分,单位 D也是C中的一部分,因此,无论单位 D属于C中的一部分,同一部分也是A中的B;因此,单位 D 整除属于C,其次为B 整除 A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-38.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-38","revisionId":"euclid-7-38@raw-5c93cf195ed3d752","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a487cc7529ba06c55115f70d94c45f68fc33a64e6df66e10d22d36bde550c7c0","citations":["euclid-7-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, alternately, the unit D measures the number B the same number of times that C measures A. [[VII. 15](/principles/euclid-7-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,换句话说,单位 D 整除,B,是C 整除 A的两倍。 [[VII. 15](/principles/euclid-7-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-38.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-38","revisionId":"euclid-7-38@raw-5c93cf195ed3d752","order":4,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"94ec1e8908c79fa6d3777056bfe57c6c61b8e1e34f2c844cbd5d297562e7fe3b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore C measures A. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,C 整除 A. 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-38.source","contentId":"euclid-7-38","revisionId":"euclid-7-38@raw-5c93cf195ed3d752","order":5,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"220477427a72ed7aa0e6b0f5d4e4ecfab0aaeda9f2fc4066773fabc6b04e7b82","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.38/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.38\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-38:euclid-7-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-38","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-38.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.38","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.38/","sourceLabel":"VII. 15"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-39:euclid-7-38:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-39","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-39.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-38","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg00